<title>USA: N.Korea to respond soon on talks proposal.</title>
<headline>N.Korea to respond soon on talks proposal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Korea has told the United States and South Korea that it will soon be ready to respond to a proposal for four-party talks on the future of the Korean peninsula, the State Department said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The North Koreans indicated that they will be prepared soon to give the United States and the Republic of (South) Korea a formal response to our joint briefing&quot; on the talks proposal, spokesman Nicholas Burns told a news briefing.</p>
</text>
